Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.42,0:00:03.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 雷  你們在幹什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.86,0:00:04.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幹什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.53,0:00:07.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在模擬和Freedom的戰鬥啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.53,0:00:09.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底有什麼事?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.64,0:00:12.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼要做這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.63,0:00:13.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為他很強
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.82,0:00:17.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望大家現在能夠瞭解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.87,0:00:20.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,至今為止戰火卻不斷蔓延的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.23,0:00:26.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說到底 這場戰爭發生的真正原因
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.81,0:00:27.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.46,0:00:32.47,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(646,632)}{\fad(500,500)}PLANT最高評議會
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.38,0:00:28.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,諾伊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.25,0:00:30.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 克莉斯塔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.04,0:00:32.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.16,0:00:34.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長在幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.70,0:00:37.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 關於這次播放我也完全…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:40.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 絕不能這樣下去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.90,0:00:42.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這種整日互相傷害的世界中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.01,0:00:44.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不會有安寧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.26,0:00:48.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那種無盡持續下去的仇恨連鎖反應
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.65,0:00:51.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們難道體驗得還不夠嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.10,0:00:56.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但卻有人無論如何都要阻礙這一切實現
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.75,0:00:58.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而且是從很久以前開始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.13,0:01:00.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,背後的他們
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.84,0:01:03.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總是熱衷於製造敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.36,0:01:08.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,熱衷於為世界帶來戰爭的軍事產業復合體
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.29,0:01:11.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,死之商人 Logos
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.01,0:01:16.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們才是我們這些期盼和平的人們真正的敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.43,0:01:21.22,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,630)}{\fad(500,500)}奧布 內閣府官邸
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.72,0:01:19.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,父親
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.97,0:01:21.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 尤拉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.34,0:01:23.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.05,0:01:26.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,利塔 格魯皮亞 克勞德氏他們的名字居然都出來了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.40,0:01:35.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我從心底盼望著不再發生戰爭的和平世界
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.29,0:01:38.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因此 告訴那些欲加以阻撓的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.41,0:01:42.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對於世界真正的敵人Logos
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.70,0:01:46.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我在此宣佈一日不滅其根本誓不罷休
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.30,0:01:52.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,狄蘭達爾……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.48,0:01:55.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,展示出的人中有和賽蘭…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:59.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 是和奧布有著複雜關係的人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.60,0:02:02.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不止是奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.24,0:02:06.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,根本就沒有任何國家和他們的全球化企業完全無關
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.32,0:02:10.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,狄蘭達爾議長到底有什麼打算
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.21,0:02:15.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 讓大家困擾了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.67,0:02:20.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但我的想法正如剛才播放的內容
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.32,0:02:24.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開戰時防衛戰之際所說的話
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.59,0:02:25.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,容我在這裡重複一次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.68,0:02:28.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,手中再次拿起的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.65,0:02:32.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次必須成為終結一切戰鬥之物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.71,0:02:36.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我很擔心奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.87,0:02:38.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今後賽蘭打算怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.48,0:02:44.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也該從他們的戰爭系統中脫離出來了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.70,0:02:48.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們真正的敵人 不是聯合也不是自然人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.14,0:02:51.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不打倒Logos 只會一再重蹈覆轍
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.34,0:02:55.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 這談何容易
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.04,0:02:58.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.53,0:03:00.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在既然看不到通往和平的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.32,0:03:04.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們可選擇的道路也就僅此而已了不是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.37,0:03:10.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,否則 這場戰爭永遠不會結束
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.79,0:03:12.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,回去吧 瑪琉艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.69,0:03:14.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,回奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.50,0:03:15.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.67,0:03:20.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,有些不同於以往的東西正在蠢蠢欲動
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.51,0:03:22.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我有這種感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.41,0:03:26.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我贊成議長的意見
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.53,0:03:28.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,正如他所說
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.57,0:03:31.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次必須給這戰爭的歷史劃上休止符
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.28,0:03:32.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,確實
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.99,0:03:33.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.91,0:03:35.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也贊成
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.55,0:03:36.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,贊成
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.19,0:03:38.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,贊成
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.58,0:03:41.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,向您的決斷與勇氣致敬
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.39,0:03:46.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.65,0:03:56.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,A-wax 006來電
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.02,0:03:59.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,區域3 地點1.36有不明物
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.81,0:04:00.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為ArchAngel
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.45,0:04:02.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,果然有行動了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.58,0:04:04.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,報告司令部
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.42,0:04:07.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,另外重寫資料庫
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.37,0:04:11.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那已經不是不明 而是敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.72,0:04:12.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.05,0:04:14.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦隊司令部來電
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.38,0:04:19.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva前往支援即將進行的Angel Down作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕たちは迷いながら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,たどり着く場所を探しつづけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しくて涙流しても
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつか輝きにかえて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,閉ざした過去が今
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,胸を搖さぶるから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,求めるほど遠く
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,置き去りの心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕らは生きるほど何かを失って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,それでも明日への
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,夢を捨てたくない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しみの理由でさえも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,つよく抱きしめていたい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,通りすぎた季節のその先に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,なにがあるのだろう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕たちは迷いながら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,たどり着く場所を探しつづけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しくて涙流しても
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつか輝きにかえて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Couse I never do not stopping my dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.56,0:06:06.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,左舵10 繞進地面的陰影處
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.36,0:06:08.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Valient 發射
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.49,0:06:19.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪琉艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.65,0:06:39.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.21,0:06:45.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.08,0:06:48.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不好 被他們壓制住了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.44,0:06:50.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.72,0:06:52.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是ZAFT為何突然這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.67,0:06:56.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,看來完全被包圍了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.34,0:06:58.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,右舷後方又出現BuCUE 8
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.65,0:07:00.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,10點方向也再出現BABI 9
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.34,0:07:02.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,導彈來襲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.74,0:07:03.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,迴避
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.97,0:07:04.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.00,0:07:08.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.01,0:07:12.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我理解盡量避免無意義的戰鬥是這艘船的理念
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.95,0:07:14.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但這樣下去會被擊沉的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.20,0:07:16.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請下達直擊的許可
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.01,0:07:20.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果您不承認 至少讓我們的Murasame隊…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.90,0:07:25.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白 但是基拉也說過吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.71,0:07:28.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,或許讓我們攻擊正是對方的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.55,0:07:30.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.50,0:07:32.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿瑪基上尉 讓我們出擊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.04,0:07:34.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Murasame一台也不能少
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.14,0:07:36.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全數帶回奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.46,0:07:49.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只要想辦法出海
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.82,0:07:51.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在此之前大家要堅持住
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.00,0:07:52.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.39,0:07:55.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,目標 再向西10
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.96,0:07:58.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,伊魯隊BABI 全隊中彈 返航
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.69,0:08:02.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是傳說中的Freedom和ArchAngel
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.10,0:08:05.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,叫MS隊別太急躁
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.11,0:08:08.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,否則支持不到Minerva趕來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.78,0:08:12.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,正因為溫吞地驅趕才使我方漸漸不利
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.37,0:08:15.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就算沒等到Minerva 只要出動全軍
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.69,0:08:21.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你不知道吧  阿拉斯加和雅金 多維戰役
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.33,0:08:27.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,欲速則不達
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.25,0:08:32.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為長遠著想 還是讓Minerva和Impulse來了斷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.64,0:08:36.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,按命令交給我軍的王牌
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.40,0:08:40.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長是說要打倒Logos
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.11,0:08:43.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那為何要去攻擊ArchAngel
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.22,0:08:45.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這道命令絕對有問題
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.36,0:08:47.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請再一次向司令部…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.14,0:08:50.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經確認過了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.61,0:08:53.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是答覆不變
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.44,0:08:56.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不表明目的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.35,0:09:00.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一味擾亂戰場擴大戰火的ArchAngel和Freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.93,0:09:06.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,考慮到今後局勢 必須剷除這個潛在的威脅
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.80,0:09:09.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是本國的決定
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.78,0:09:10.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.54,0:09:15.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經無能為力了 作戰早已開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.09,0:09:28.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,捕捉到A-wax傳來的信號
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.91,0:09:30.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,顯示情況圖
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.76,0:09:46.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你也別再裏足不前了 阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.02,0:09:51.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白你不想跟以前的戰友作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.68,0:09:55.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 時過境遷 人心也會改變的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.75,0:09:59.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是也變了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.09,0:10:11.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好好看著現在
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.71,0:10:16.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長 已收到A-wax的信號
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.48,0:10:18.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,即將到達作戰區域
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.32,0:10:20.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.93,0:10:26.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.25,0:10:32.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不想看的話就待在房間裡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.94,0:10:38.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 和那艘船作戰我們也會以死相拼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.14,0:10:45.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦橋遮蔽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.64,0:10:47.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發令紅色狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.83,0:10:50.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對艦對MS戰鬥準備
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.89,0:10:51.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發令紅色狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.29,0:10:54.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,駕駛員請在搭乘機內待命
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.54,0:10:57.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,CIWS Tristan Isolde啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.35,0:11:01.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射管一號至三號 全炮門裝填Parsifal
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.61,0:11:06.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.45,0:11:10.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的 你做得到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.87,0:11:23.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Thank You
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.61,0:11:30.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.98,0:11:38.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.07,0:11:47.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,距離地點20 即將遇敵
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.00,0:11:50.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射干擾彈 Impulse出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.93,0:11:51.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.91,0:11:56.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,探測器…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.01,0:11:59.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是干擾彈
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.86,0:12:01.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,左舵10 下降
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.03,0:12:10.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 飛鳥  核心戰機出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.03,0:12:44.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開始攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.87,0:13:07.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.63,0:13:12.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,捕捉到ArchAngel 距離2000
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.27,0:13:14.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Isolde 發射
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.18,0:13:33.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.05,0:13:34.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.06,0:13:37.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會 為什麼那艘船要…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.98,0:13:39.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,連那都能避開
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.74,0:13:43.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,主角登場了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.61,0:13:47.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就讓庫拉提斯露兩手給我們看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.42,0:14:01.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不要緊 別胡亂移動就不會中彈
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.87,0:14:04.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,果然沒打算擊中
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.78,0:14:09.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,梅琳 打開國際救援頻道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.51,0:14:11.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.29,0:14:16.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是ZAFT艦Minerva艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.57,0:14:17.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,塔利雅 庫拉提斯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.46,0:14:20.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ArchAngel 聽得見嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.44,0:14:25.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長 Minerva發來的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.37,0:14:32.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本艦奉司令部命令前來擊沉貴艦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.58,0:14:41.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果貴艦現在停止包括艦載機在內的一切攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.74,0:14:45.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,投降的話 本艦也會停止攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.66,0:14:46.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:49.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,命令可是擊毀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.73,0:14:51.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,庫拉提斯這傢伙到底想幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.99,0:14:52.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.27,0:14:54.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僅此一次警告
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.45,0:14:57.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,過時不候
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.38,0:15:00.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,向你們保証乘員的生命安全
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.95,0:15:05.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,望貴艦三思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.24,0:15:09.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.48,0:15:14.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是那艘Minerva的艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.53,0:15:17.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不想與之為敵啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.64,0:15:20.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 如果在這裡向ZAFT投降
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.51,0:15:21.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉大人的安全…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.81,0:15:22.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿瑪基
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.84,0:15:25.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.35,0:15:31.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,去海上 送卡嘉莉回奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.40,0:15:32.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以此為最優先
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.78,0:15:34.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉 怎麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.17,0:15:37.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,米莉雅麗亞 打開和對方相同的頻道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.18,0:15:38.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.58,0:15:43.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是ArchAngel艦長  瑪琉 拉米亞斯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.34,0:15:48.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,感謝貴艦的好意 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.09,0:15:48.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.72,0:15:53.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.06,0:15:55.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 非常遺憾
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.09,0:15:57.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們無法接受
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.35,0:16:01.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本艦還有工作
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.08,0:16:03.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聯合還是PLANT
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.09,0:16:06.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,世界正被分為兩種顏色時
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.95,0:16:09.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本艦似乎又成了礙眼的顏色
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.55,0:16:15.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但正因為如此 更不能在這裡被抹去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.35,0:16:20.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,願能允許我們脫離
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.02,0:16:24.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,庫拉提斯這蠢貨
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.77,0:16:26.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,看看你幹了什麼蠢事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.56,0:16:29.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓MS隊重新開始攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.51,0:16:33.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被小看了 絕不允許他們逃離
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.52,0:16:44.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別逃
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.44,0:16:46.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.36,0:16:49.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,維拉德隊長 怎麼自作主張
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.53,0:16:51.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不攻擊就會讓他們逃掉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.41,0:16:54.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們自己不也這麼說嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.56,0:17:00.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是FAITH
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.74,0:17:01.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如此膽小的婦人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.91,0:17:04.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被人羞辱怎能就此罷休
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.36,0:17:10.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva不幹的話由我們來幹
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.06,0:17:11.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.58,0:17:18.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 ArchAngel
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.48,0:17:28.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總是這一招
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.55,0:17:31.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別以為一直能奏效
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.99,0:17:39.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 別…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.37,0:17:40.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉他…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.96,0:17:55.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Freedom的確動作迅速
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.72,0:17:58.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,射擊也準確
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.57,0:18:01.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但那台機體絕對不瞄準駕駛艙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.89,0:18:07.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,攻擊的總是武裝和主監視器
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.58,0:18:10.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Impulse的勝機就在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.01,0:18:29.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,梅琳  胸部組件 Force Silhouette
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.03,0:18:58.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.65,0:19:09.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說了別想逃
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.36,0:19:14.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是你殺了史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.20,0:19:22.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我都那麼拚命想阻止了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.61,0:19:31.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,距離海岸線10
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.69,0:19:32.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣支撐不下去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.02,0:19:33.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請出動Murasame
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.02,0:19:34.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,甩掉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.54,0:19:36.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.11,0:19:39.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀 哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.62,0:19:41.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼這裡總是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.54,0:19:43.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.44,0:19:52.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你今天得在這裡被我打下來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.84,0:19:57.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼…到底是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.44,0:20:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,梅琳  Sword Silhouette
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.28,0:20:00.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.41,0:20:04.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,即將到達海岸線
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.54,0:20:06.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,會被逃脫的 艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.34,0:20:10.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Tannhauser 啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.93,0:20:12.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,目標 ArchAngel
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.89,0:20:18.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,緊急隔離壁封閉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.44,0:20:19.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,準備下潛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.09,0:20:20.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.95,0:20:22.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉 基拉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.57,0:20:24.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉大人的話不用擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.90,0:20:27.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,放出Rouge 我去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.95,0:20:28.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.74,0:20:56.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快 讓它下潛就完了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.80,0:20:59.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.66,0:21:36.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.53,0:21:52.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了 史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.25,0:21:55.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣總算…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.32,0:22:06.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今でも氣付かないでしょう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,この靜かな空に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつでも思い出すけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,もうどこにももどれない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,そしてずっと心で醒めて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,そっと氣付いて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつかきっとやさしさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,見えてくるように
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,What's stopping me? I get stuck again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it really OK? It's never OK for me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,What's got into me? I get lost again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it really OK? It's never going to be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.55,0:23:25.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,曾相信的是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.60,0:23:27.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是他的話語
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.05,0:23:29.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還是認為不會發生
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.93,0:23:32.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,像萬花筒般變換意義的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.19,0:23:35.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是世界 還是自己的心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.48,0:23:39.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為戰士們準備的下一個舞台是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.54,0:23:44.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下集 機動戰士GUNDAM SEED DESTINY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.18,0:23:46.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,混沌的前方
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.33,0:23:50.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,降落到夢想的世界吧 Destiny
